    <releaseNotes>
      Preserve unsaved documents when Save As is cancelled or saving fails before closing.
      Save through a unique sibling temporary file, preserving the original and backup on write failure.
      Commit document filename and modified state only after successful file replacement.
      Honour window-close cancellation from the save prompt and retain WinForms click-handler signatures.
      Expand regression coverage to 77 tests and fix filtered NUnit test execution.
    </releaseNotes>
